            "review_title": "Review at Choi Oi Noodle",
            "review_text": "meri06\nL'Aquila, Italy2884 contributions\n0\nRecommended!\nJun 2025 • Couples\nVery kind staff, nice and quaint local. Very good food and expertly cooked with care. Excellent ravioli, spicy noodles and rice with tempera. Excellent miso soups. Honest account, two of us spent about 17€ on drinks. Advice!\nTranslated from Italian\nShow original\nWritten June 1, 2025",
